        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\t\t 2.07m x 4.06m \t\t\t\r\n                                         3.46m x 2.58m \r\nTiled floor, Alarm\t\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\t\t 3.77m x 4.36m \t\t\t\r\nSolid timber floor, open fireplace\r\n\r\nDS Bed/Sitting Room\r\nPlayroom\t\t 3.28m x 4.47m\t\t\t\r\nSolid timber floor\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining\t\t5.6m x 7.61m \t\t\t\r\nFully fitted kitchen with cooker and hob, tiled floor, Solid fuel stove, patio door to rear\r\n\r\nGuest WC\t\t2.14m x 1.46m \t\t\t\r\nTiled walls, WC, wash hand basin, shower cubicle, electric shower, mirror\r\n\r\nBedroom Two \t\t5.18m x 3.28m \t\t\t\r\nSolid timber flooring, coving.\r\n\r\nLanding\t 3.79m x 1.26m & 1.23m x 3.74m \r\nHot-press.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three:  3.09m x 5.83m \t\t\t\r\n\r\nEn-Suite \t2.11m x 2.86m \t\t\t\r\nTiled floor, WC, wash hand basin, shower cubicle, mirror\r\n\r\nBedroom Four \t\t3.12m x 3.77m \r\n\r\nBedroom Five\t\t3.99m x 6.17m \t\t\t\r\nStorage\r\n\r\nBathroom \t\t    2.32m x 2.85m\t \t\t\r\nTiled floor, bath, WC, wash hand basin, wall mirror,electric shower, partially tiled wall.\r\n\r\nStorage \t\t1.29m x 1.95m \t\t\t\r\nCarpet floor"
